Problem
Create a bash script named official_backup.sh to zip the /var/www/html/official directory and copy it to the Nautilus Storage Server.

Solution
bash
#!/bin/bash
# /scripts/official_backup.sh

# Create zip archive
zip -r /backup/xfusioncorp_official.zip /var/www/html/official

# Copy to Nautilus Storage Server
scp /backup/xfusioncorp_official.zip storage-server-user@storage-server-ip:/backup/
Setup Commands:

bash
# On App Server 1
sudo yum install zip
ssh-keygen -t rsa
ssh-copy-id storage-server-user@storage-server-ip
mkdir -p /scripts
chmod +x /scripts/official_backup.sh
./scripts/official_backup.sh
